@baseUrl = http://localhost:5086
@electronics = 8c5d2b52-8a2b-4f4e-9d6a-1b8f0c3e2a01

### 0) Login: copie o accessToken da resposta para a variável @token abaixo
POST http://localhost:5088/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{ "email": "admin@store.dev", "password": "Store@2026" }

###
@token = cole-o-token-aqui

### Listar categorias (vem com 3 do seed)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/categories

### Criar produto (exige token; sem ele → 401)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/products
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Notebook Pro 14",
  "description": "16 GB de RAM, SSD de 512 GB",
  "sku": "nb-pro-14",
  "price": 7499.90,
  "initialStock": 15,
  "categoryId": "{{electronics}}"
}

### Criar com SKU repetido → 409 Conflict
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/products
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Outro notebook",
  "sku": "NB-PRO-14",
  "price": 100,
  "initialStock": 1,
  "categoryId": "{{electronics}}"
}

### Criar com dados inválidos → 400 com erros por campo (ValidationDecorator)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/products
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "",
  "sku": "x",
  "price": -1,
  "initialStock": -1,
  "categoryId": "00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000"
}

### Listar com filtro e paginação
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/products?name=note&page=1&pageSize=10

### Excluir categoria com produtos → 409 Conflict
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/api/categories/{{electronics}}
